&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>
&lt;ul>
&lt;li>&lt;strong>Creation&lt;/strong>: Knowledge is generated through engineering and operational work&lt;/li>
&lt;li>&lt;strong>Structuring&lt;/strong>: Information is organized using defined templates and taxonomy&lt;/li>
&lt;li>&lt;strong>Storage&lt;/strong>: Content is stored in centralized repositories&lt;/li>
&lt;li>&lt;strong>Discovery&lt;/strong>: Users access knowledge through search and navigation&lt;/li>
&lt;li>&lt;strong>Reuse&lt;/strong>: Existing knowledge is applied across teams and workflows&lt;/li>
&lt;li>&lt;strong>Governance&lt;/strong>: Content is maintained, reviewed, and updated over time&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul>
&lt;hr>
&lt;h3>System View&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="system-view">&lt;/span>
